1.2.17 Initialization Order

This is a high-priority output-prediction topic.

Your module explicitly gives the initialization sequence and requires exact superclass/subclass ordering. 

Basic

1. What is class initialization?


2. What is instance initialization?


3. What is a static field initializer?


4. What is a static initialization block?


5. What is an instance initializer block?


6. What is constructor execution?


7. What is initialization order?



Intermediate

8. In what order are static fields and static blocks executed?


9. When is a superclass initialized?


10. When is a subclass initialized?


11. When are instance fields initialized?


12. When are instance initializer blocks executed?


13. When does the constructor body execute?


14. Why does superclass initialization happen before subclass initialization?



Exact Output Questions

class Parent {
    static {
        System.out.println("Parent static");
    }

    {
        System.out.println("Parent instance");
    }

    Parent() {
        System.out.println("Parent constructor");
    }
}

class Child extends Parent {
    static {
        System.out.println("Child static");
    }

    {
        System.out.println("Child instance");
    }

    Child() {
        System.out.println("Child constructor");
    }
}

15. What is printed when:



new Child();

is executed?

16. Which static block executes first?


17. Which instance initializer executes first?


18. Which constructor executes first?


19. Why?



Advanced

20. What happens if a class is loaded but not initialized?


21. What causes class initialization?


22. How does inheritance affect initialization?


23. What happens if a static initializer throws an exception?


24. What is initialization failure?


25. What is <clinit>?


26. What is <init>?


27. Why is class initialization synchronized between threads?


28. How can circular initialization create unexpected behavior?



Major Trap

> "Parent constructor runs first because constructors are always executed before child initialization."



Is this correct?

No. Static initialization happens before object construction, and parent static initialization precedes child static initialization.

Production

29. Why should static initialization avoid expensive I/O?


30. Why can complex static initialization increase startup time?


31. How can static initialization failures bring down an application during startup?


